OL,3,ANetherlands moves billions in gold to
OL,4,ALondon in 'crisis preparedness' move
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe decision comes amid an ongoing
OL,7,Ftrade dispute between the US and
OL,8,FCanada, with both countries announcing
OL,9,Ffresh tariffs on each other after
OL,10,Ffailed trade talks.
